  "raw": "{\"answer\":\"按执行顺序为：句子分割、图检索、推理。KG-GPT 被分为这三阶段，“each designed for breaking down sentences, sourcing related graph elements, and reaching reasoned outcomes” [chunk_45c598ca774c47ab2be0c3b734efd4de]。三步骤也写作“Sentence (Claim / Question) Segmentation, Graph Retrieval, and Inference” [chunk_a4963bc9a949cc8fa87d1c46b7c95760]。句子分割阶段“a sentence is partitioned into discrete sub-sentences, each aligned with a single triple” [chunk_a4963bc9a949cc8fa87d1c46b7c95760]；原文还说该方法把句子拆分到对应单一关系的子句，便于识别关系 [chunk_e702747b8cb7850698f65ab65a3d7d8c]。图检索阶段“retrieves a potential pool of relations that could bridge the entities identified within the sub-sentences”，随后用检索到的关系和实体集得到证据图候选池 [chunk_a4963bc9a949cc8fa87d1c46b7c95760]。推理阶段“the obtained graphs are used to derive a logical conclusion, such as validating a given claim or answering a given question” [chunk_a4963bc9a949cc8fa87d1c46b7c95760]。\",\"citations\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_45c598ca774c47ab2be0c3b734efd4de\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_a4963bc9a949cc8fa87d1c46b7c95760\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_a4963bc9a949cc8fa87d1c46b7c95760\",\"quote_id\":\"q2\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_e702747b8cb7850698f65ab65a3d7d8c\",\"quote_id\":\"q2\"}],\"status\":\"ok\"}",
